B.Yw=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,24,"Capitals in Sentences","Start every sentence with a capital letter.","Ali is in Lahore. Sara went to Multan. Hamza and Omar play in Karachi. Zara likes the park. Bilal made a quiet plan. Maryam wrote a long letter. Usman lives near Islamabad.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","","Both Shift keys, both little fingers",u._)
B.Zv=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,25,"Question and Exclamation","Type ? and ! with Shift.","Why? How? Who? What? When? Where? Wow! Yes! Stop! Look! Where is Ali? He is in Lahore! What time is it? Please wait! How are you? Great job!",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","?!","? is Shift + / (right little) \xb7 ! is Shift + 1 (left little)","For ? hold the LEFT Shift and press / with your right little finger. For ! hold the RIGHT Shift and press 1 with your left little finger.")
B.Z1=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,26,"Apostrophe and Quotes","Type ' and \" correctly.","it's don't I'm she's can't they're we'll \"Hello,\" said Ali. \"Come in,\" said Sara. \"Thank you,\" I said. Don't forget the \"quotes\" and it's done.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation","'\"","Right little finger: ' (and Shift + ' for \")","The apostrophe is next to the semicolon. Hold the LEFT Shift for the double quote.")
B.YM=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,27,"Colon and Hyphen","Type : with Shift and - with your right little finger.","Note: Task: Goal: Step: Rule: well-known long-term self-made full-time one-way check-in Name: Ali. Plan: well-made. Tip: take a long-term view.",90,0,"Stage 4 \xb7 Shift & Punctuation",":-","Right little: : (Shift + ;) and - (hyphen)","Colon is Shift + semicolon. Hyphen is on the number row, to the right of 0.")
